at, how to get around, which form to fill in, what is on this week, and who to ask when something goes wrong. Too often that information is scattered across posts, chats and noticeboards, and finding it depends on knowing the right person."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0","children":"We want to change that. Our aim is simple: to make information easier to find, and to give life at Tha Prachan a central anchor, one place every student can come back to, whatever they need and whenever they need it."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0","children":"We believe the two bodies serve students better together than apart. Building one site between us means no student has to know which body looks after what. They only need to know to come here."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0","children":"This site belongs to the students it serves, and it will keep growing as we learn what you need. If something is missing, unclear or wrong, tell us."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"about-service","className":"flex flex-col gap-[var(--space-2)]","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"about-service","children":"About this service"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0","children":"Everything a Thammasat Tha Prachan student needs, in one place"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0","children":"This is a new service still being tested. Some information may be incomplete"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"about-bodies","children":"Student bodies"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"m-0 flex flex-col gap-[var(--space-2)] pl-[var(--space-6)]","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/en/about/tusu","className":"font-medium text-action underline","children":"Thammasat University Student Union, Tha Prachan"}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/en/about/tusc","className":"font-medium text-action underline","children":"Thammasat University Student Council, Tha Prachan"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0","children":["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/en/about/open-data","